  "absence_and_binary_exclusion": "Independent checker rereads complete original input and validates every physical occurrence and absence; binary closure certificates cover8 individual residual values and16 pairs under compatible14-literal prefix. Every unexcluded case has a consistent partial assignment closed under every original binary implication; every excluded case carries original-binary RUP witnesses, independently checked. All4 final tuples independently original-CNF RUP checked.",
